ius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">all the male Olympians except Dionysus are going to be exclusive tops, so that's not going to work...</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-15T18:10:15-07:00","id":1129524,"title":"","content":"If everybody's posts are telling me anything about myself, it's that it's be shorter for me to make a list of goddesses I wouldn't be interested in.<br /> <br /> That'd probably be... Like, Hera's wrath is legendary... Hel's probably out due to the half-corpse thing... Maybe one or two of the more brutal Teotl ladies...<br /> <br /> But if Brigid or the Morrigan or Het-Heru came up to me and said &quot;You. You're cute. We're gonna bone,&quot; my answer would probably be to squeak out a &quot;Be gentle, please&quot;. I mean if a GODDESS wants a piece of you... Myth says that refusing her outright can have consequences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"M