:"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12975-zealot_vedas","name":"Zealot_Vedas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12975_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T17:06:21-07:00","id":1140359,"title":"","content":"I'd try to steer clear of the theoi goddesses. I like my ... everything just the way it is and where it is. That said, i am very fond of the more, shall we say, romantic interpretation of the Persephone myth. So i probably wouldnt be able to resist her.<br /> Aside from that i'd say, Chang'e, Amaterasu, Nephthys, Freya and Brigid. I'd also be curious to learn more about the manitou goddesses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T12:33:59-07:00","id":1140596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1129320-gods-and-goddesses-you-have-crushes-on?p=1138011#post1138011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Iris: golden-winged messenger of the Theoi and goddess of the rainbow. If I ever get a chance to run Scion, Iris will be a thoroughly modern goddess who will have expanded her Purviews to cover radio communications and the Internet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Iris needs more love. <br /> <br /> (I confess to having long been mildly annoyed that the post 1985 revamp of Wonder Woman had her getting her speed powers as a gift from Mercury rather than from Iris. &quot;You will be the champion of womankind, granted great gifts by the Greek Goddesses ,,, and one God.&quot; But then I've also been long miffed that DC retconned Mary Marvel into getting the same SHAZAM powers as her brother instead of the unique goddess derived powers she originally had.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T15:53:56-07:00","id":1141237,"title":"","content":"I don't generally go in for romantic stuff and I've heard too many stories of what happens to gods' mortal lovers to really want in on that train, but I don't think I'd be able, or want to resist if WicDiv's Inanna came onto me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13075-malicwanderer","name":"MalicWanderer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13075_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-17T18:48:44-07:00","id":1141276,"title":"","content":"Niamh of the Golden Hair. I think that she's been pretty lonely since Oisin. I would like to make her happy again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13647-manannansun","name":"Manannansun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T17:28:01-07:00","id":1141596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MalicWanderer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1129320-gods-and-goddesses-you-have-crushes-on?p=1141237#post1141237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't generally go in for romantic stuff and I've heard too many stories of what happens to gods' mortal lovers to really want in on that train, but I don't think I'd be able, or want to resist if WicDiv's Inanna came onto me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> One guy got turned into a chair for falling in love with a nymph. She asked Zeus to give him eternal life, and Zeus shockingly agreed to do so.<br /> <br /> But, of course, this is a Greek Tragedy, so he didn't give the man eternal youth to go along with it. Causing him to age to the point where he was completely immobile. When his nymph lover asked Zeus to help him; boom, he gets turned into a chair!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-18-2017, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T02:22:21-07:00","id":1141693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1129320-gods-and-goddesses-you-have-crushes-on?p=1141596#post1141596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> One guy got turned into a chair for falling in love with a nymph. She asked Zeus to give him eternal life, and Zeus shockingly agreed to do so.<br /> <br /> But, of course, this is a Greek Tragedy, so he didn't give the man eternal youth to go along with it. Causing him to age to the point where he was completely immobile. When his nymph lover asked Zeus to help him; boom, he gets turned into a chair!</div> </div> </div> </div>Eos made the same mistake with Tithonus, and his shrinking and bending produced the first cricket.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"user